SUMMARY:Toronto Potters Reception
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Potters Reception            \n                                    \n                                \n                        \n                                                \n                                                        Free Registration                        \n                                            \n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n	\n\n	\n\n\n			\nEvents\n	\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n	\n\n	\n\n	\n\n\n				\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n	\n\n\n			\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Thursday October 15\, 2026\n6:00 pm – 8:00 pm \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Join us to celebrate the Gardiner Shop retail feature Vessels and Visions. The Toronto Potters Association presents this collection that celebrates the creativity\, craftsmanship\, and individual voices of their community of ceramic artists. \nThere will be drinks available for purchase. \n  \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n\n        \n          \n          \n                        \n               \n                General : Free Registration\n                                        \n                      \n\n                    \n          \n            \n  \n            \n                                Free Registration\n              \n                        \n           \n                \n                \n                    \n                        \n                    \n                \n                \n          \n          \n        \n\n	\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Featured Artists\n\nAhlena Sultana-McGarry\, Andrea Charise\, Andrea Poorter\, Andrea Sinclair\, Anne Kobayashi\, Brenda Nieves\, Caroline Yu\, Carolynn Bloomer\, Chloe Begg\, Darryl Barnes\, Deborah Hatanaka\, Hana Balaban-Pommier\, Jo Murphy\, Maddie Gabriel\, Natasha Martin\, Reed Burridge\, Reginald Leung\, Salina Szechtman\, Shivaun Gingras\, Talia Silva\, Thomas Paik \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    About Toronto Potters \nThe Toronto Potters Associations is a volunteer run\, nonprofit organization\, dedicated to a community of clay enthusiasts\, bringing together makers\, teachers and collectors since 1979. \nFor more than four decades\, our association has provided its members with opportunities for artistic growth\, professional development\, and community connection. Through juried exhibitions\, guest lectures\, monthly meetings\, educational workshops\, newsletters\, and access to our studio\, the association continues to nurture and celebrate the diverse practices of its members. \n  \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         
URL:https://www.gardinermuseum.on.ca/event/toronto-potters-reception/
